('The Azure Villa', 'azure-villa', 'A stunning cliffside villa overlooking the Aegean Sea in Santorini. Featuring private infinity pool, sun terrace, and breathtaking sunset views. Perfect for romantic getaways and luxury retreats.', 'Cliffside luxury villa with private infinity pool and Aegean Sea views.', 'Santorini, Greece', 'Villa', 350.00, 4.9, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582268611958-ebfd161ef9cf?w=600&h=400&fit=crop', 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1),
